"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"bd7acd1192e46962\" href=\"?note=bd7acd1192e46962\" title=\"17-df-theory-properties\">17-df-theory-properties</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"e8f9375543fc2e7d\" href=\"?note=e8f9375543fc2e7d\" title=\"17-df-language-cardinality\">17-df-language-cardinality</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"53255a372e5c1ee8\" href=\"?note=53255a372e5c1ee8\" title=\"17-df-model\">17-df-model</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"6c973042c939008f\" href=\"?note=6c973042c939008f\" title=\"17-df-cardinal-saturation\">17-df-cardinal-saturation</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"c8c9b6ed48fe2f37\" href=\"?note=c8c9b6ed48fe2f37\" title=\"17-df-unary-morley-rank\">17-df-unary-morley-rank</a></span></div>"},{"key":"label_origin","html":"local-catalog"},{"key":"legacy_label","html":"17-df-7.2.2b"},{"key":"local_revision","html":"content audit of supplied 17(1).zip; inherited source_verification and bibliographic fields not independently reverified"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Ord}\">\\(\\mathrm{Ord}\\)</span> 采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"c8c9b6ed48fe2f37\" href=\"?note=c8c9b6ed48fe2f37\" title=\"17-df-unary-morley-rank\">17-df-unary-morley-rank</a> 所依赖的序数元类。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span> 是可数语言 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L\">\\(L\\)</span> 的完全理论，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Complete}\">\\(\\operatorname{Complete}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"bd7acd1192e46962\" href=\"?note=bd7acd1192e46962\" title=\"17-df-theory-properties\">17-df-theory-properties</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"|L|\">\\(|L|\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"e8f9375543fc2e7d\" href=\"?note=e8f9375543fc2e7d\" title=\"17-df-language-cardinality\">17-df-language-cardinality</a>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Mod}(T)\">\\(\\operatorname{Mod}(T)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Saturated}_{\\aleph_1}\">\\(\\operatorname{Saturated}_{\\aleph_1}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"53255a372e5c1ee8\" href=\"?note=53255a372e5c1ee8\" title=\"17-df-model\">17-df-model</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"6c973042c939008f\" href=\"?note=6c973042c939008f\" title=\"17-df-cardinal-saturation\">17-df-cardinal-saturation</a>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Rank}_{\\mathfrak C}\">\\(\\operatorname{Rank}_{\\mathfrak C}\\)</span> 采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-11\" data-note=\"c8c9b6ed48fe2f37\" href=\"?note=c8c9b6ed48fe2f37\" title=\"17-df-unary-morley-rank\">17-df-unary-morley-rank</a> 的全参数一元秩；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(\\operatorname{lit}(v_0)=\\operatorname{lit}(v_0))\">\\((\\operatorname{lit}(v_0)=\\operatorname{lit}(v_0))\\)</span> 是该语言的一元恒真公式；变量符号不直接充当项。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{TotallyTranscendental}_L\">\\(\\operatorname{TotallyTranscendental}_L\\)</span> 在此定义。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{TotallyTranscendental}_L(T)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\operatorname{Complete}(T)\\land|L|\\leq\\aleph_0\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\forall\\mathfrak C\\in\\operatorname{Mod}(T)\\;\n\\left[\\operatorname{Saturated}_{\\aleph_1}(\\mathfrak C)\\to\n\\exists\\alpha\\in\\mathrm{Ord}\\;\\operatorname{Rank}_{\\mathfrak C}((\\operatorname{lit}(v_0)=\\operatorname{lit}(v_0)),\\alpha)\\right].\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{TotallyTranscendental}_L(T)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\operatorname{Complete}(T)\\land|L|\\leq\\aleph_0\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\forall\\mathfrak C\\in\\operatorname{Mod}(T)\\;\n\\left[\\operatorname{Saturated}_{\\aleph_1}(\\mathfrak C)\\to\n\\exists\\alpha\\in\\mathrm{Ord}\\;\\operatorname{Rank}_{\\mathfrak C}((\\operatorname{lit}(v_0)=\\operatorname{lit}(v_0)),\\alpha)\\right].\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>原书 §7.1 p500 定义理论的秩为其 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\aleph_1\">\\(\\aleph_1\\)</span>-饱和模型中 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x=x\">\\(x=x\\)</span> 的秩，并以它为序数定义全超越。这里保持本节可数语言、一元秩范围；不把无参数公式秩冒充 Morley 秩。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"17-df-theory-properties","status":"resolved","id":"bd7acd1192e46962","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[17-df-theory-properties]]","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-language-cardinality","status":"resolved","id":"e8f9375543fc2e7d","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[17-df-language-cardinality]]","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-model","status":"resolved","id":"53255a372e5c1ee8","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[17-df-model]]","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-cardinal-saturation","status":"resolved","id":"6c973042c939008f","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[17-df-cardinal-saturation]]","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-unary-morley-rank","status":"resolved","id":"c8c9b6ed48fe2f37","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[17-df-unary-morley-rank]]","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-unary-morley-rank","status":"resolved","id":"c8c9b6ed48fe2f37","anchor":"ref-6","targ